# OnyxOS v2 — Stripped Linux + AI-Native Kernel

> **Pivot:** Instead of a userspace-only framework, we're building a **real operating system** by stripping Linux down to its bones and replacing the core subsystems with AI-native equivalents.

## The Vision

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Traditional Linux          →    OnyxOS                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  systemd (PID 1)            →    onyx-init (Rust)           │
│  CFS scheduler              →    onyx_sched (market auction)│
│  cgroups (manual)           →    auto-cgroups (per agent)   │
│  apt/dnf packages           →    agent registry (hot-load)  │
│  top/htop                   →    onyx-hud (market dashboard)│
│  /var/log                   →    event stream (structured)  │
│  X11/Wayland                →    AR overlay (future)        │
│  bash                       →    voice + LLM shell          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

