## Boot Sequence

```
Power On
   │
   ▼
UEFI/BIOS (Jetson bootloader)
   │
   ▼
Linux Kernel 5.15 (stripped, ~5MB)
   │  - Mount initramfs
   │  - Load NVIDIA GPU driver
   │  - Load onyx_sched.ko
   │
   ▼
onyx-init (PID 1) [<500ms]
   │  - Mount /proc /sys /dev /tmp
   │  - Set up cgroup v2 hierarchy
   │  - Configure network
   │
   ▼
OnyxD (the daemon) [<1s]
   │  - Parse system.toml
   │  - Initialize thermal governor
   │  - Initialize power monitor
   │  - Load inference engine
   │  - Scan agent manifests
   │  - Start market ticker
   │
   ▼
Agents come alive
   │  - Register with OnyxD
   │  - First auction runs
   │  - Winners get resources
   │  - Losers degrade or suspend
   │
   ▼
OnyxOS READY (~3s total boot)
   │
   ▼
HUD available on :8080 or TTY
```

